WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.670
Park a black car and a white
car side by side in bright

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.890
sunshine.

3
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:09.030
By the afternoon, the black car's
roof is far too hot to touch,

4
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.530
while the white one is only warm.

5
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.350
Then the sun sets, and
both cars start to cool.

6
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.770
So which one cools down faster?

7
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.290
In this mission, you'll find
out that every object both gives

8
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.060
out and takes in infrared radiation.

9
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:28.410
You'll compare dark, matt
surfaces with light, shiny ones,

10
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.450
and see how the same ideas help
keep the Earth's temperature

11
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.790
steady.

12
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.550
Your mission: find out which
car cools down faster at night.
